<div class="incident-case incident-ticket" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{CASE_PREFIX}}-title">
<header class="incident-ticket-header">
<div class="incident-ticket-topline"><span class="incident-ticket-id">{{CASE_TICKET_ID}} <span>· Example incident ticket</span></span><span class="incident-ticket-status"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> Response open</span></div>
<h3 id="{{CASE_PREFIX}}-title">{{CASE_ACCOUNT}} export is missing required customer records</h3>
<p class="incident-ticket-dates">Opened {{CASE_OPENED_AT}} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Updated {{CASE_UPDATED_AT}} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Investigation checkpoint</p>
</header>
<div class="incident-ticket-body">
<dl class="incident-ticket-metadata"><div><dt>Reported by</dt><dd>{{CASE_ACCOUNT}} · {{CASE_REPORTED_VIA}}</dd></div><div><dt>Incident owner</dt><dd>{{CASE_OWNER}}</dd></div><div><dt>Affected service</dt><dd>Customer-data export · revision {{CASE_SERVICE_REVISION}}</dd></div><div><dt>Assigned investigator</dt><dd>Agent session {{CASE_SESSION}} · investigation Work item</dd></div></dl>
<div class="incident-ticket-report"><h4>Customer report</h4><blockquote><p>“{{CASE_CUSTOMER_REPORT}}”</p></blockquote></div>
<div class="incident-ticket-impact"><span class="incident-ticket-metric">{{CASE_MISSING_COUNT}}</span><div><strong>Required identifiers missing from output {{CASE_OUTPUT}}</strong><p>{{CASE_REQUIRED_COUNT}} identifiers required; {{CASE_OUTPUT_ROW_COUNT}} rows exported. The saved identifier comparison confirms the omission. Other accounts and downstream impact remain unassessed.</p></div></div>
<dl class="incident-ticket-scope"><div><dt>Account</dt><dd>{{CASE_ACCOUNT}}</dd></div><div><dt>Filters</dt><dd><code>{{CASE_FILTERS}}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Source snapshot</dt><dd><code>{{CASE_SNAPSHOT}}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Export run</dt><dd>{{CASE_RUN}} · output <code>{{CASE_OUTPUT}}</code></dd></div></dl>
<div class="incident-ticket-panels">
<div class="incident-ticket-investigation"><h4>Investigation update</h4><dl><div><dt>Root cause</dt><dd>Not yet established</dd></div><div><dt>Containment / recovery</dt><dd>Not yet established</dd></div><div><dt>Proposed fix</dt><dd>Revision {{CASE_FIX_REVISION}} · candidate, efficacy unverified</dd></div></dl><p class="incident-ticket-agent-state"><strong>Agent paused</strong>Task view {{CASE_VIEW_VERSION}} has expired. Refresh the view and confirm current permission before further work.</p></div>
<div class="incident-ticket-actions"><h4>Next actions</h4><ol><li>Restore current task context and confirm the investigation delegation.</li><li>Investigate cause and the extent of customer impact.</li><li>Evaluate revision {{CASE_FIX_REVISION}} and submit the evidence for owner review.</li></ol><p>Deployment and incident closure require separate authorization.</p></div>
</div>
<details class="incident-ticket-activity"><summary>Activity and evidence <span>5 updates</span></summary>
<ol class="incident-ticket-timeline"><li><time>09:42</time><div><strong>Incident opened</strong><p>The owner records the reported <strong>Failure Occurrence</strong> and takes responsibility for the response.</p></div></li><li><time>09:45</time><div><strong>Investigation assigned</strong><p>Session {{CASE_SESSION}} receives a Work Assignment and a separate 30-minute delegation to inspect saved material and prepare review material.</p></div></li><li><time>09:55</time><div><strong>Omission confirmed</strong><p>Method {{CASE_METHOD_VERSION}} compares identifiers in snapshot {{CASE_SNAPSHOT}} and output {{CASE_OUTPUT}} under completeness definition {{CASE_DEFINITION_VERSION}}. An Evidence Set preserves the result for a bounded <strong>Failure Assessment</strong>.</p></div></li><li><time>10:03</time><div><strong>Candidate response saved</strong><p>Revision {{CASE_FIX_REVISION}} is proposed for evaluation. No recovery or deployment is established.</p></div></li><li><time>10:10</time><div><strong>Agent work paused</strong><p>Task view {{CASE_VIEW_VERSION}} expires; the incident response remains open.</p></div></li></ol>
<p class="incident-ticket-evidence"><strong>Recorded evidence</strong> Input snapshot {{CASE_SNAPSHOT}} · saved output {{CASE_OUTPUT}} · identifier comparison, method {{CASE_METHOD_VERSION}} · Operational Observation version {{CASE_OBSERVATION_VERSION}}</p>
</details>
</div>
<div class="incident-ticket-footer"><span>Incident record: active · Response: open</span><span>Fictional ticket · times in UTC</span></div>
</div>
